s is why there isn't too much reason to get bothered or frustrated at this album. When they are this easy to tear apart, I know we've already won. </p>"],[2,3268631,3265668,4,0,4,"2015-11-20T18:49:24","Rakosman","",[],"<p>I just realized how appropriate the term <em>wallow</em> is</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Wallow:</p>\n<p>(chiefly of large mammals) roll about or lie relaxed in mud or water, especially to keep cool, avoid biting insects, or spread scent.</p>\n</blockquote>"],[3,3273747,3268631,2,0,2,"2015-11-21T02:58:31","Puzzlebark","",[],"<p>fucking gold, have an upvoat my deep fried friend!</p>"],[1,3265899,0,3,0,3,"2015-11-20T11:52:45","medved_pls","",[],"<p>She's a terrible human being. I can't stand her. She reeks of insecurity and bitterness, whenever I see &quot;misandry&quot; in a url I can be assured the user will be full of shit but she's definitely the worst.</p>"],[1,3266277,0,2,0,2,"2015-11-20T13:32:23","ScheissKaiser","",[],"<p>She's one of my &quot;favorites&quot;!</p>\n<p>Thanks Achtung, I would never personally go on tumblr and spend time to dig out shit like this.</p>"],[1,3266839,0,2,0,2,"2015-11-20T15:10:38","Lilina","",[],"<p>A buttergolem? They are hideous creatures with no filters.</p>"],[1,3267178,0,1,0,1,"2015-11-20T16:03:36","Zephoria","",[],"<p>Reading though all of them and I realize I am following satanic-anti-feminist (he got blocked by her) and I'm happy. </p>"],[1,3267728,0,1,0,1,"2015-11-20T17:09:13","SkySailing","",[],"<p>I couldn't make it through to the end. I fucking hate this pig. </p>"],[1,3268905,0,1,0,1,"2015-11-20T19:11:46","NPBFatpatrol","",[],"<p>&quot;Im super concerned with my appearance so instead of getting in shape ill........ change my hair color.&quot;</p>"],[1,3269631,0,1,0,1,"2015-11-20T20:21:07","ctrlcutpaste","",[],"<p>I can't read any further. The self entitlement and the delusions of not only her but that she has followers who believes the same is so fucking sad. </p>"],[1,3271994,0,1,0,1,"2015-11-20T23:47:14","Fayutt","",[],"<p>I like how all its posts are like one liners up until the response to the picture of a fit woman, then it goes ballistic and vomits up a multi-page, illiterate tirade. </p>"],[1,3272536,0,2,0,2,"2015-11-21T00:41:02","salad_monger","",[],"<p>Fats really need to stop dying their hair. I love dying my hair all sorts of weird colors and I hate having something in common with them.</p>"],[1,3274208,0,1,0,1,"2015-11-21T03:58:55","ChubsShouldDie","",[],"<p>It's really hard to say &quot;most revolting whale ever&quot;, but... this thing is up there.</p>"]]
